  "summary": "RLSCompiler.compileFilter now runs the two shared comparand faces (assertListComparandShapes, normalizeFilterComparandTypes from @objectstack/spec/data) on every compiled policy filter, for using and check alike, with or without a field guard. A refused policy joins deniedBy with reason 'refused-comparand', the per-request route the type family already takes. On every driver measured (InMemoryDriver, SqlDriver/SQLite, SqlDriver/PostgreSQL 16), all five null-family predicates now answer DENY (fail closed) with the WARN and 0 rows on read, and 403 on check, identical to the type-family control. Every policy without a null-family comparand is byte-identical base to head. The lint finding text that said the RLS layer skips the faces was corrected. Two pending changesets that read false after the change got one-clause corrections, and check-empty-changeset stays red on them by design. The real-stack pin is SqlDriver-only because a new driver-memory test consumer needs a maintainer ruling (census gate); InMemoryDriver was measured, not pinned.",
  "tests": "new plugin-security/src/rls-null-comparand-fails-closed.test.ts (real stack, SqlDriver) + rls-compiled-comparand-faces.test.ts (compileFilter unit): 2 files, 84 passed at 2a0d7da0b1 | pnpm --filter @objectstack/plugin-security test: 139 files, 2839 passed at 2a0d7da0b1; run typecheck exit 0 (check:test-typecheck OK) at 2a0d7da0b1 | pnpm --filter @objectstack/lint test: 109 files, 4232 passed at f3eb1d06c4; run typecheck exit 0 at 4d66d4d572 (lint source unchanged since) | pnpm --filter @objectstack/driver-memory test: 56 files, 1362 passed at f3eb1d06c4 | pnpm --filter @objectstack/objectql test: 318 files, 5762 passed at 4d66d4d572 (pre-merge of origin/main; diff does not touch objectql) | pnpm --filter @objectstack/driver-sql test with OS_TEST_POSTGRES_URL on a private PostgreSQL 16 (server zone Asia/Shanghai, TZ=America/New_York): 196 files passed, 3 skipped; 3806 passed, 86 skipped (MySQL cells unprovisioned); live postgres RAN; at 4d66d4d572 | ablation at 2a0d7da0b1 via scripts/ablation-replace.mjs: 'const comparands = judgeCompiledComparands(outcome.filter);' replaced by a pass-through (anchor 1 to 0, blob 2438357788 to e6a410b0b5); the two new files went 42 failed / 42 passed of 84 (every null-family cell red, every control and accepted-predicate cell green); restore proved by blob == HEAD and empty git diff HEAD; direction: turns red. Subject imported from src by relative path, so no dist build/preflight applies | probe (scratch, not committed) at base 805af4f290 vs head blob 2438357788, 243 cells per side over memory/sqlite/pg: 192 byte-identical, 51 differ, all null-family | eslint --no-inline-config --format json on the 5 changed .ts files: 5 files, 0 errors, 0 warnings; all 5 in eslint population (--print-config resolves); config enables no type-aware linting (parserOptions.project / projectService null), so untouched files cannot change verdict",
