  "deviations": [
    "Seam: RLSCompiler.compileFilter, not the 'one engine seam' of triage's words. The write check never passes the engine's composed where, so a call only there flips the disagreement. compileFilter is where using, check and analytics' getReadFilter all compile, and where the type family's DENY (fail closed) route lives. The engine's composed where gets no call: every other producer composing onto ast.where (tenant Layer 0, controlled-by-parent, plugin-sharing, attachment/comment hooks, the engine's search filter) is platform-produced with no authored comparand, and a refusal there could only be a 400.",
    "Real-stack pin on SqlDriver only (triage note 1 names InMemoryDriver too): check:driver-memory-census refuses an unledgered driver-memory consumer. A first version added the devDependency, the census went red, and it was reverted. InMemoryDriver was measured by probe, base and head. See open_questions[0].",
